 424+ 7E1F
 425+ 7E1F              ; set global transparency fallback
 426+ 7E1F ED 91 14 00      NEXTREG $14, 0
 427+ 7E23
 428+ 7E23              ; load the colours into the palette memory
 429+ 7E23              ; here we are using 9 bit colours, so use $44 to do the load
 430+ 7E23
 431+ 7E23              ; first initialise the palette index to 0
 432+ 7E23 ED 91 40 00      NEXTREG $40, 0
 433+ 7E27
 434+ 7E27              ; set the number of colours
