 469+ 837C              ; buildMapImage - render the whole 256x192 map into Layer 2
 470+ 837C              ;
 471+ 837C              ; Optimised: the slot-6 page offset (y/32) and the in-page
 472+ 837C              ; address high byte ((y&$1F)|$C0) are constant for a whole row,
 473+ 837C              ; so they are computed ONCE per row. Columns are walked with
